      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIL REX (5) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 43.53 beating Oregon Janet. Awkwardly drawn but goes well at this distance. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from three starts. Expected to be right there at the finish again. RIGHT TO RUN (1) is a well performed dog and winner of nine races who was in the minor money last time out at this track (44.08). Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of four starts. Goes very well from this draw with five wins and two minor placings from seven starts. Overdue and is among the main hopes. URANA SPACE (3) used the rails draw to advantage to get home last time at Murray Bridge over 680m (39.31), scoring by 6 lengths. Expected to feature again. SECRETS WE KEEP (7) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish.",
